{"product_id":"frankie-peaches-and-me","title":"Frankie, Peaches and Me","description":"\u003cp\u003eWish you were here! Stella, along with her mum, dad and mildly mad twin brothers, has just moved from buzzy London to the sleepy seaside town of Potbay. Not only has she had to leave her best mate Frankie behind but she's also kissed goodbye to Seb - only the guy she's ever liked. Still, Portbay's got its own charms; they might just take a little discovering... \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Karen McCombie \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781407117768 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 224\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44970741366937,"sku":"13RB9781407117768","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/c39d55cd7917184c82bd72fa7a53ed2b.jpg?v=1752084652","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/frankie-peaches-and-me","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}